    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "We see the hero in their normal life before the adventure begins. This establishes their baseline, including their limitations, flaws, and unfulfilled desires. Its purpose is to ground the story and give the audience a clear sense of what will change",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "BEAT: 2. Call to Adventure",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "A challenge, threat, or opportunity presents itself, inviting the hero into a new world. This moment introduces the central conflict and sets the story in motion.",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "BEAT: 3. Refusal of the Call",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "The hero hesitates or rejects the call due to fear, doubt, obligation, or insecurity. This beat humanizes the hero and emphasizes the risk involved in the journey.",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "BEAT: 4. Meeting the Mentor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "The hero encounters someone who provides guidance, tools, training, or encouragement. The mentor helps prepare the hero for what lies ahead, often giving them confidence or a key resource.",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "BEAT: 5. Crossing the First Threshold",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000023",
      "lineType": "action",
      "content": "The hero commits to the journey and enters the “special world,” leaving the familiar behind. This is a point of no return and marks the true beginning of the adventure.",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locationId": null,
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000024",
      "lineType": "blank",
      "content": "",
